---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Contact
permalink: /contact/index.html
---
<section class="hero">
  <h1 class="brand-name">Contact</h1>
  <p class="bio-text">This is mostly a maker log, but feel free to get in touch.</p>
  <p class="meta-line">Questions, feedback, and bug reports are always useful.</p>
</section>

<section class="panel">
  <h2 class="section-title">Ways to connect</h2>
  <ul class="list-reset mono-list">
    {% for method in profile.contact %}
      <li><a href="{{ method.url }}">{{ method.label }}</a></li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  <p class="meta-line">If you are writing about a project, include the project name and a quick summary.</p>
</section>
